OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FExtreme weather conditions play a
OL,7,     Frole in the death or serious
OL,8,     Finjury of four people a day on
OL,9,     FUK's roads. In this edition, cops
OL,10,     Fdeal with dangerous drivers who
OL,11,     Fput lives at risk.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FAJ and Richie pursue a van
OL,14,     Fspeeding through narrow country
OL,15,     Flanes. Sparks fly when dog handler
OL,16,     FJustin and police dog Elsa capture
OL,17,     Ftwo burglars.
