OL,12,     FA motorist is stuck in his car,
OL,13,     Funable to move his legs, and may
OL,14,     Fhave suffered a serious spinal
OL,15,     Finjury. A man in a hard-to-reach
OL,16,     Frural location has cut his leg
OL,17,     Fwith an angle grinder.
